  instructions: "Use a qualified CAD MCP binding to create a new run-owned handle from the current reviewed specification. Follow its dimensions and process requirements, including any explicitly reviewed changes from the original input defaults; do not retain obsolete fixed dimensions in this step. Export the exact built revision as STEP and source STL. Retain the editable model identity and preview as declared outputs. Stop if unavailable; do not replace CAD with a narrative."
